{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268uJG6xhi3r1794527671.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>新秀麗第三季純利按年減少近兩成一。</p><p></p><p>至5,810萬美元。銷售額則與去年相同，有8.7億美元。毛利率擴闊1.7個百分點，至百分之61.3。</p><p></p><p>總計首九個月，純利按年減少兩成二，至1.49億美元。銷售額則微增百分之0.7，至25.5億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:39:13.778615+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.621419+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T00:32:39.216246+00:00","content_hash":"196e2ca6074716a3556991ec6a843cc885107a9bff03aa3747cb6f5898da86ff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:39:13.778615+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}